# Post-edit sanity checks

After changing **application or build-relevant source** (e.g. `src/**`, root config like `next.config.*`, `tsconfig.json`, `components.json`, `biome.json`, env schema), run both:

```bash
bun run check
bun run typecheck
```

- **`check`** — Biome lint/format (`biome check .`).
- **`typecheck`** — TypeScript (`tsc --noEmit`).

Do **not** skip these for substantive edits; fix failures before finishing. Trivial-only changes (comments, markdown under `.cursor/` or docs-only) may skip if clearly non-executable.

## `package.json` scripts

| Script | Command | Purpose |
|--------|---------|---------|
| `dev` | `next dev --turbo` | Local dev server |
| `build` | `next build` | Production build |
| `start` | `next start` | Run production server (after `build`) |
| `preview` | `next build && next start` | Build then smoke-run prod locally |
| `check` | `biome check .` | Lint + format check (no writes) |
| `check:write` | `biome check --write .` | Auto-fix safe Biome issues |
| `check:unsafe` | `biome check --write --unsafe .` | Biome with unsafe fixes (use sparingly) |
| `typecheck` | `tsc --noEmit` | Typecheck without emitting JS |
| `db:generate` | `drizzle-kit generate` | Generate SQL migrations from schema |

Prefer **`bun run <script>`** in this repo (Bun package runner).
